WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.208
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:05.750
SPEAKER: We're all aware of how
important customer experience

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.590
is.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:09.470
And your contact center is
right on the front lines,

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.030
with customers
asking for support

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.730
from all of the different
channels of communication.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:16.970
Providing great service on top
of this huge volume of requests

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:19.820
can be hard and intimidating
with a traditional contact

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:20.730
center.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:23.690
Imagine providing your
customers with immediate 24/7,

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:27.740
AI-driven self-service in a way
that's natural and seamless,

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:30.170
an unforced conversation
that transitions them

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:33.260
to a human agent who can tap
into an AI-powered knowledge

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.740
base that allows for quicker,
more accurate resolution.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.130
That's where Google Cloud's
Contact Center AI comes in.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:41.600
At the core of
the technology are

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.860
bots that can talk, listen,
learn, and understand.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.450
This lets them
converse naturally

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:50.270
with customers, resolving
basic issues directly,

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:52.940
and assist via human
agents on complex call,

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.880
providing real time,
turn by turn guidance.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.250
Combining the best
of Google Cloud's AI

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:00.290
with the power of
the Genesys Cloud,

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:03.410
Contact Center AI will improve
your customer experience

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:07.310
and increase your operational
efficiency at the same time.

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:09.470
The Genesys and Google
Cloud relationship is

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:12.140
seamless and allows
your AI agent developers

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:15.440
to update variables and
responses on the fly.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.410
You'll have the ability to drive
the discovery of end user needs

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:19.530
in real time.

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:22.070
So you can stop worrying about
compensating ahead of time

00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:23.900
for every possible outcome.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.600
You'll create the business
logic and deliver conversation

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.510
management so that, by the
time the conversation reaches

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:32.540
a live agent, your custom data
collection environment will

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.400
already be established,
bringing it

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.890
into the conversation
with the human agent.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.370
Speech-to-Text takes in text
and understands the intent

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.650
and uses Google's natural
language processing

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:45.410
to look at intent and
return the entities.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.110
Genesys Architect allows
administrators and contact

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:51.320
center managers to link
together predefined operations

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:53.390
to create simple or
sophisticated menu

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:54.620
applications.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:56.810
Use it to play audio,
route interactions

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:00.290
to agents, cues, voicemail,
external numbers,

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:01.640
or other flows.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:04.310
Incorporate advanced features,
such as non-menu digit

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:07.220
collection, data dips,
conditional logic,

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.020
and expression editing.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:11.660
You'll need a Google Cloud
Platform account and a Google

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:15.280
Dialogflow agent to develop
using Genesys Architect.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.270
Dialogflow is Google
Cloud's solution

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:20.210
for creating automated
conversational experiences,

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:23.300
often called bots
or virtual agents.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:26.030
It's easy to start
building in Dialogflow.

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:29.780
You can import the agent into
Genesys any time you're ready.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:31.800
Here's how you'd get started.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.400
Create the Google Dialogflow
Platform Service Account

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.570
credential.

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:37.760
Obtain the Google
Dialogflow integration

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.770
from Genesys AppFoundry.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:44.090
Create and configure the Genesys
Cloud OAuth client credentials.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:46.880
Configure the Google Dialogflow
Platform Service Account

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.110
credential.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:50.780
Configure the Genesys
Cloud OAuth credentials,

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:52.730
and then activate
Google Dialogflow

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.960
and activate the integration.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:57.440
Set up a Genesys
Cloud Architect flow,

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.330
and then associate
the Google Dialogflow

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:01.520
bot with the Architect flow.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:05.740
Route a Genesys Cloud phone
number to the Architect flow.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:07.660
Once your Genesys
integration is complete

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:10.510
and your bot is running, you'll
spot trends and get ahead

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:13.810
of your always growing customer
demand with analytics tools

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:15.820
that allow you to stay in tune.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.610
Today's digital age means
instant gratification.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:22.240
And Google Cloud's AI technology
enables you to reach customers

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:25.300
immediately, without putting
them through a long phone tree

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.580
or placing them on
an extended hold.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.550
Transform your agents
into specialists.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:33.020
Agents shouldn't waste
time searching for answers,

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.350
looking for the most
helpful customer resources,

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:37.120
or even typing up their notes.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.750
Instead, Contact Center AI
will anticipate customer needs

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.720
and serve as actionable
insights, making the agent

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.720
a better resource for your
customer, your business,

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:48.520
and your bottom line.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.310
Since Google Cloud's Contact
Center AI and Genesys

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:54.280
have partnered, you can now
deliver world class customer

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:58.030
experiences that blend AI and
Google Cloud voice interaction

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.220
technologies with
Genesys call center

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.470
automation and orchestration.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:05.130
Come see what it's all about.

